# Agent Task: Seen-IDs TTL Cleanup

On each scan run in lib/scrape-pipeline.ts, after fetching seenIds, prune any zpid whose associated scan date (stored as hyh:seen-id-ts:<zpid> string key) is older than 90 days. Add addSeenIds to also write hyh:seen-id-ts:<zpid> = ISO date with 90-day TTL. Remove orphaned entries from the set via SREM.

## Test requirements
Unit tests for: pruning logic with mock timestamps, no-op when all ids are recent, correct SREM calls.
